# mobius strip FIXED
# all triangles are oriented to the middle of object

# vertices 5 & 6 duplicated to 11 & 12 to avoid non-orientability

# bottom
v 0 0 0
v 4 0 0
v 4 4 0
v 0 4 0

# the "funky part" left
v -4 2 4
v 0 2 4

# up
v 0 4 8
v 0 0 8
v 4 4 8
v 4 0 8

# FIX

# these values produce look-alike
# v -4 2 4
# v 0 2 4

# these values show it as open-mesh, because it is
v -4 2 4.5
v 0 2 4.5

# bottom
f 1 2 3
f 1 3 4

# funky left
f 1 4 5
f 1 5 6

# FIXED part
f 12 11 7
f 12 7 8

# up
f 7 9 8
f 9 10 8

# right
